    'incident.s4.retention' => 'Shorten the retention wherever it is a choice rather than a legal floor: it is the only lever that lowers the figures in section 3, because it shortens how long that data still has to stay secret.',
    'incident.s4.reencrypt' => 'Re-encrypt what is still held with an algorithm whose expiry falls after the duration asked.',
