    'effort.limit' => 'The EU roadmap counts the migration effort among the three factors of quantum risk. This tool counts it in places, because that is what a repository can tell; it does not turn that into a duration. Eight call sites in one file behind one function are an afternoon; eight across six services with a protocol between them are a quarter, and nothing in the files distinguishes the two. That estimate is yours.',
